<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1629420529"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:11.805"><div begin="17.017" end="34.799" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="17.017" end="21.437" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.017" end="17.944">终于看</span><span begin="17.944" end="19.025">见了</span><span begin="19.025" end="19.395">世</span><span begin="19.395" end="20.168">界本</span><span begin="20.168" end="21.437">尊</span></p><p begin="21.515" end="25.845" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.515" end="22.084">终于</span><span begin="22.084" end="23.472">不需要</span><span begin="23.472" end="23.907">你</span><span begin="23.907" end="24.575">的保</span><span begin="24.575" end="25.845">护</span></p><p begin="25.969" end="30.089" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.969" end="26.248">迈开</span><span begin="26.248" end="26.814">脚步</span><span begin="26.814" end="27.222">突</span><span begin="27.222" end="27.406">然</span><span begin="27.406" end="28.764">感激这种荒</span><span begin="28.764" end="30.089">芜</span></p><p begin="30.411" end="34.799" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.411" end="30.668">从前</span><span begin="30.668" end="31.178">被锁</span><span begin="31.178" end="31.682">上</span><span begin="31.682" end="31.835">的</span><span begin="31.835" end="32.906">我们多么</span><span begin="32.906" end="33.516">孤</span><span begin="33.516" end="34.799">独</span></p></div><div begin="34.829" end="53.234" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="34.829" end="39.129" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.829" end="35.698">原来我</span><span begin="35.698" end="36.857">的家</span><span begin="36.857" end="37.224">该</span><span begin="37.224" end="37.948">长这</span><span begin="37.948" end="39.129">样</span></p><p begin="39.318" end="43.554" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.318" end="40.141">原来我</span><span begin="40.141" end="41.305">有天</span><span begin="41.305" end="41.680">敌</span><span begin="41.680" end="42.405">要害</span><span begin="42.405" end="43.554">怕</span></p><p begin="43.714" end="48.094" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.714" end="44.013">栖息</span><span begin="44.013" end="44.546">或探</span><span begin="44.546" end="44.978">险</span><span begin="44.978" end="45.197">再</span><span begin="45.197" end="46.186">来还给我</span><span begin="46.186" end="46.676">思</span><span begin="46.676" end="48.094">量</span></p><p begin="48.211" end="53.234" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.211" end="48.502">你撤</span><span begin="48.502" end="49.035">退的</span><span begin="49.035" end="49.410">地</span><span begin="49.410" end="49.619">方</span><span begin="49.619" end="50.661">才是我的</span><span begin="50.661" end="51.301">天</span><span begin="51.301" end="53.234">堂</span></p></div><div begin="53.382" end="1:05.271" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="53.382" end="55.583" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.382" end="53.512">当</span><span begin="53.512" end="53.769">青</span><span begin="53.769" end="53.920">苔</span><span begin="53.920" end="55.051">绿回最初</span><span begin="55.051" end="55.208">的</span><span begin="55.208" end="55.408">颜</span><span begin="55.408" end="55.583">色</span></p><p begin="55.593" end="58.009" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.593" end="55.841">死</span><span begin="55.841" end="56.130">亡</span><span begin="56.130" end="56.299">和</span><span begin="56.299" end="56.558">孕</span><span begin="56.558" end="56.707">育</span><span begin="56.707" end="56.940">自</span><span begin="56.940" end="57.315">然</span><span begin="57.315" end="57.540">发</span><span begin="57.540" end="58.009">生</span></p><p begin="58.199" end="1:03.110" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.199" end="58.729">自由</span><span begin="58.729" end="58.921">从</span><span begin="58.921" end="59.336">来</span><span begin="59.336" end="1:00.154">就不是</span><span begin="1:00.154" end="1:00.570">多</span><span begin="1:00.570" end="1:00.995">余</span><span begin="1:00.995" end="1:03.110">的</span